---
description: Key CLI commands for deploying and managing this project on Cloudflare
alwaysApply: false
---

## Deploy to Cloudflare Pages
```bash
npx wrangler pages deploy public --project-name apex-iq-tester
```

## D1 Database
```bash
# Query remote
npx wrangler d1 execute iq-tester-db-test --remote --command "SELECT * FROM results LIMIT 10;"

# Run SQL file
npx wrangler d1 execute iq-tester-db-test --remote --file schema.sql
```

## Secrets
Push all secrets from .dev.vars to Cloudflare Pages (run each, paste value when prompted):
```bash
npx wrangler pages secret put STRIPE_API_KEY --project-name apex-iq-tester
npx wrangler pages secret put TIER1_LINK_ID --project-name apex-iq-tester
npx wrangler pages secret put TIER2_LINK_ID --project-name apex-iq-tester
npx wrangler pages secret put TIER3_LINK_ID --project-name apex-iq-tester
npx wrangler pages secret put TEMP_LINK_LIFETIME_HOURS --project-name apex-iq-tester
npx wrangler pages secret put ADMIN_CONTACT --project-name apex-iq-tester
npx wrangler pages secret put SHARETHIS_ADDIN --project-name apex-iq-tester

# List all secrets currently set
npx wrangler pages secret list --project-name apex-iq-tester
```

## Local Dev
```bash
npx wrangler pages dev public
```
